From: nalsai
Subject: Fix command creation for unnamed tracks and remuxing

Audio tracks without a title use their numeric sampling frequency as the
display name. Normalize it to text before storing it, and defensively convert
all track names used in output filenames. Also import Qt for the remux dialogs.

